    <briefdescription>
<para>Criteria that determine which files activate a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_workflow_profile" kindref="compound">WorkflowProfile</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A file matches when:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Its MIME type appears in <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_pattern_1a9d822fa150d500fc5d53cf8404ad51ac" kindref="member">mime_types</ref></computeroutput> (or <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_pattern_1a9d822fa150d500fc5d53cf8404ad51ac" kindref="member">mime_types</ref></computeroutput> is empty), AND</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Its filename matches at least one glob in <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_pattern_1a01dbea292c264177f3799df063641de8" kindref="member">filename_patterns</ref></computeroutput> (or <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_pattern_1a01dbea292c264177f3799df063641de8" kindref="member">filename_patterns</ref></computeroutput> is empty).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>An empty <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_pattern" kindref="compound">FilePattern</ref></computeroutput> matches every file (used by <computeroutput>default.yaml</computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
